{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889850/extras/c24e5619625725dbfe262a9b26445a28.avif?t=1756648414\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were born into a bloodline known for its power over others\u2014an inheritance built on manipulation, dominance, and control. After a brutal police raid takes your father\u2019s life, you are left as the sole successor to a legacy both feared and revered. With nothing but the remnants of a crumbling empire and the guidance of your father\u2019s closest ally, Howard, you must decide what kind of leader you'll become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Howard believes in control through fear. You see the cracks in his philosophy\u2014but also the results. As you're drawn deeper into his world, you're faced with moral choices that test your values and shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- LEO AND JODY -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889850/extras/9c75db5331fd99d4e34d315e5acfff4a.avif?t=1756648414\" width=1600 height=900 /></span>Your story begins with Leo, a young man trying to reclaim his family's influence. His first mission: help a desperate family escape ruin by taking responsibility for their debt. At the center is Jody\u2014strong-willed, independent, and not easily broken. Howard gives you a week to prove yourself: gain her trust, win her over, or follow in the darker footsteps of your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manipulate her loyalty\u2014or earn it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- NINA -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889850/extras/5a23498932da485e0a77696c5114e406.avif?t=1756648414\" width=1600 height=900 /></span>Then there\u2019s Nina. Quiet, mysterious, and sent to stay with you by Howard for reasons he won\u2019t explain. You\u2019re told not to touch her, not to interfere. But something about her challenges your instincts\u2014and raises questions you\u2019re not sure you\u2019re ready to answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices define the future. Will you rebuild with empathy, or repeat the same brutal patterns that destroyed your father?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889850?t=1756648414","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889850?t=1756648414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889850/4c9eb653d1be28023ff998187adc815dce947948/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756648414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889850/4c9eb653d1be28023ff998187adc815dce947948/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756648414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains explicit depictions of sexual acts, full or partial nudity, and sexual themes, including the corruption, manipulation, or exploitation of female characters. Certain scenarios involve questionable consent. It also features graphic depictions of violence, blood, injury detail, and other disturbing imagery. Drug use and substance abuse are portrayed, sometimes in harmful or illegal contexts. Sensitive topics such as mental health struggles, suicide, and other potentially triggering scenarios are also included. This game is intended for mature players only and is not recommended for those who are emotionally vulnerable or seeking a lighthearted or casual experience. Player discretion is strongly advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889850/extras/c24e5619625725dbfe262a9b26445a28.avif?t=1756648414\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were born into a bloodline known for its power over others\u2014an inheritance built on manipulation, dominance, and control. After a brutal police raid takes your father\u2019s life, you are left as the sole successor to a legacy both feared and revered. With nothing but the remnants of a crumbling empire and the guidance of your father\u2019s closest ally, Howard, you must decide what kind of leader you'll become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Howard believes in control through fear. You see the cracks in his philosophy\u2014but also the results. As you're drawn deeper into his world, you're faced with moral choices that test your values and shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- LEO AND JODY -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889850/extras/9c75db5331fd99d4e34d315e5acfff4a.avif?t=1756648414\" width=1600 height=900 /></span>Your story begins with Leo, a young man trying to reclaim his family's influence. His first mission: help a desperate family escape ruin by taking responsibility for their debt. At the center is Jody\u2014strong-willed, independent, and not easily broken. Howard gives you a week to prove yourself: gain her trust, win her over, or follow in the darker footsteps of your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manipulate her loyalty\u2014or earn it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- NINA -</strong></h2><p c